      <div class="why">
         <div class="container">
            <h2 class="title">Why Roxbury Community College?</h2>
            <div class="subtitle">RCC offers <a href="/succeed/academic-support.html"><strong>unmatched student support</strong></a> and <a href="/learn/find-your-program/index.html">quality instruction</a> by <a href="/succeed/student-success.html"><strong>professors invested in your success</strong></a>. In addition, our state-of-the-art facilities and technology assistance are available
               to all students.</div>
            <div class="row why__row">
               <div class="col-md-4 why__col why__align_left">
                  <div class="why__item">
                     <div class="why__title">
                        				Reputable
                        			</div>
                     <div class="why__item-in"><img class="why__item-img" src="/_resources/_images/icons/rcc-reputation-icon-2022_BlackStroke-120.png" alt=""><div class="why__text">
                           <div class="why__num">
                              						91%
                              					</div>
                           <div class="why__description">
                              						of students recommend RCC
                              					</div>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <div class="col-md-4 why__col why__align_center">
                  <div class="why__item">
                     <div class="why__title">
                        				Affordable
                        			</div>
                     <div class="why__item-in"><img class="why__item-img" src="/_resources/_images/icons/Affordable-icon-2022_BlackStroke-120.png" alt=""><div class="why__text">
                           <div class="why__num">
                              						FREE
                              					</div>
                           <div class="why__description">
                              						for qualifying MA residents
                              					</div>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <div class="col-md-4 why__col why__align_right">
                  <div class="why__item">
                     <div class="why__title">
                        				Innovative
                        			</div>
                     <div class="why__item-in"><img class="why__item-img" src="/_main_images/icons/diversity-icon-2022_BlackStroke-120-new.png" alt=""><div class="why__text">
                           <div class="why__num">
                              						100%
                              					</div>
                           <div class="why__description">
                              						of RCC students take college-level math
                              					</div>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>
            <div class="why__btn-w"><a href="/explore/about-rcc.html" class="why__btn btn_size_l btn btn_style_ghost-blue">LEARN MORE</a></div>
         </div>
      </div>
      
